7
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:07,080
restaurant ?

8
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,580
Et qu'il gagnait un dessert ?

9
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:08,820
Demain,

10
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,040
